        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST FOUR BEDROOM / TWO BATHROOM HOUSE, KINGSBRY, MAYNOOTH LOCATION AVAILABLE NOW \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this four-bedroom / two-bathroom property to the rental market in Kingsbry, Maynooth. This recently renovated property is well presented throughout and offers comfortable modern living in a peaceful and well-established residential setting. Ideally located and within reach to, Maynooth University (15-minute walk), Maynooth Train Station (10-minute walk) and Maynooth Town Centre (15-minute walk, along with a host of local amenities including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities.\nThe property also benefits from excellent and easy access transport links with the M4 motorway network and Irish Rail services nearby. Internal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, spacious Living Room, Brand New fitted kitchen, 1 dining area,1 utility room, 3 double-bedrooms, 1 single bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. Available now and viewing is highly advised. \nFeatures: \n4 bedroom / 2 bathroom house.\nRecent Full Renovation.\nFully fitted kitchen.\nSpacious Back and front garden\nOil Heating.\nSpacious front garden for parking.\nA host of local amenities nearby. (village shopping centre) \nHighly Sought after location. (close to M4, train station and Maynooth university)\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
      },
